#
# Line endings are pinned to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true by default) checks the
# files out as CRLF, which contradicts `files.eol: "\n"` in
# .vscode/settings.json and makes a diff between a Windows and a Linux
# contributor show every line as changed. Pinning it here settles the
# question once for everyone instead of once per machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.h5  binary
*.dxf binary
